{"t":"Glooth Factory","s":"glooth-factory-a6a7b","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Glooth_Golem_349285.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Glooth Factory</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Glooth Golem\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Glooth_Golem_349285.gif\" width=\"64\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"city\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Near city</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Rathleton\">Rathleton</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"location\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Location</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Lower%20Rathleton\">Lower Rathleton</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33549,31928,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33549, 31928, 7)</a>.</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">10.50<br/>July 7, 2014<br/>Summer Update 2014</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>The <b>Glooth Factory</b> is an old factory on <a href=\"#/wiki/Oramond\">Oramond</a> in the western part of <a href=\"#/wiki/Rathleton\">Rathleton</a>. <a href=\"#/wiki/Fillias\">Fillias</a> says about it:\n</p>\n<div style=\"max-width: 60%;\">\n<div class=\"NPCQuote messagebox\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span class=\"npc\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fillias\">Fillias</a></span>: <span class=\"msg\">Big building just across the street here. Completely ruined, now. Some strange accident years and years ago there, but it was all hushed up. I heard they built a new factory in the workshops quarter. Hah.</span><br/><span style=\"padding: 0 1em; font-size: 90%; line-height: 90%; font-style: italic;\">[[{{{NPC}}}/Transcripts|Read more...]]</span></div><br/>\n</div>\n<p>The new factory is called the <a href=\"#/wiki/Underground%20Glooth%20Factory\">Underground Glooth Factory</a>, with the entrance found in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Workshop%20Quarter\">Workshop Quarter</a>.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures\">Creatures</span></h2>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Glooth%20Blob\"><img alt=\"Glooth Blob\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Glooth_Blob_ec709c.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Glooth%20Blob\">Glooth Blob</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">700</td><td style=\"text-align: cen